# AQ Fund Dashboard

An interactive air-quality monitoring and analysis dashboard developed with **R** and **Shiny** for the University of Chicago Energy Policy Institute's AQ Fund work.

The application brings together ground-monitoring records, satellite-derived PM₂.₅ estimates, geographic layers, monitoring-network coverage indicators, and time-series analysis in a single responsive interface.

