## Deployment

Before deployment:

1. Confirm that all required data and map-cache files are present.
2. Restore the project environment with `renv::restore()`.
3. Regenerate deployment metadata when the R or package environment changes.
4. Configure credentials and environment-specific secrets outside the repository.
5. Launch and test all three UI components in the target environment.

